@host = https://localhost:7247

### Alle Checklisten
GET {{host}}/api/checklists

### Eine Checkliste
GET {{host}}/api/checklists/1

### Item in einer Checkliste
GET {{host}}/api/checklists/1/items/4

### Item anlegen
POST {{host}}/api/checklists/1/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Taschenlampe",
  "description": "mit batterien",
  "quantity": 2,
  "isPacked": true
}

### Item aktualisieren
PUT {{host}}/api/checklists/1/items/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Taschenlampe blau",
  "description": "Taschenlampe LED mit 1000 lumen",
  "quantity": 2,
  "isPacked": true
}

### Item löschen
DELETE {{host}}/api/checklists/1/items/4